Package: loxkit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: uuid-stable Loxone to TimescaleDB bridge and dashboard server
 A long-running daemon that authenticates to a Loxone Miniserver over its
 websocket, resolves the uuid map, and writes a clean stream of uuid-keyed
 readings into TimescaleDB. Keying every series on the stable uuid means a
 rename in Loxone Config is a label change, never a new series.
 .
 Ships alongside it loxweb, a config-driven dashboard server that reads the
 same TimescaleDB store and charts it from a declarative view definition.
